<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>That was terribly rude of me. 
{PAUSE ""}
I did not mean to startle you, but with this appearance, it is no wonder...<PG>
Besides, I noticed that you had arrived and came in a hurry.<PG>
That is... 
{PAUSE ""}
I truly beg your pardon. 
{PAUSE ""}
I will be careful from now on.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
